<!-- =======================================================
     02 / SMART BUILDING
     ======================================================= -->

<CaseSection
  number="02"
  label="Smart Building"
  title="Making a technical proposal easier to see."
  intro="While waiting for the RekMed integration work to require design support, I was asked to help Datacakra's design and marketing teams visualize part of a Smart Building proposal."
>
  <p>
    The proposal described an integrated monitoring
    environment combining CCTV analytics, energy
    monitoring, AC monitoring and control, alerts,
    reporting, and a centralized web dashboard.
  </p>

  <p>
    For the CCTV side of the proposal, the system
    needed to communicate capabilities such as
    intrusion detection, crowd detection, loitering
    detection, camera health, and real-time incident
    alerts.
  </p>

  <p>
    My responsibility was not to design the entire
    pitch deck or product from zero. The marketing
    material already existed, and my supervisor had
    established a visual direction through earlier
    Figma explorations.
  </p>

  <p>
    I was given a verbal brief and asked to extend
    that existing design language into a convincing
    dashboard mockup that could be inserted directly
    into the proposal.
  </p>
</CaseSection>


