     03 / REKMED
     ======================================================= -->

<CaseSection
  number="03"
  label="RekMed × SATUSEHAT"
  title="Understanding an existing healthcare product before helping prepare it for integration."
  intro="The main internship project involved RekMed, Datacakra's existing web-based electronic medical record and clinic-management application, and a SATUSEHAT integration effort that had been inactive before the new intern team was assigned to it."
>
  <p>
    Unlike the Smart Building task, my contribution
    here was not primarily visual interface design.
  </p>

  <p>
    I first needed to understand a product I had not
    designed: what pages existed, what users could do
    on each page, where patient information entered
    the system, and which actions changed or produced
    medical data.
  </p>

  <p>
    I studied the existing RekMed guidebook, explored
    the development version of the application
    myself, and discussed unfamiliar integration
    requirements with the project-management intern
    when the technical documentation was unclear to
    me.
  </p>
</CaseSection>


