<!-- =======================================================
     04 / REQUIREMENTS MAPPING
     ======================================================= -->

<CaseSection
  number="04"
  label="Requirements Mapping"
  title="The task was broader than deciding whether an input should accept text or numbers."
>
  <p>
    The integration work exposed a larger requirements
    problem: different patients, visit types, and
    clinical workflows do not always require the same
    information.
  </p>

  <p>
    The working board therefore mapped both the data
    that needed to exist and the interface conditions
    under which that data would be requested.
  </p>

  <p>
    My role was to help make those requirements more
    concrete for the implementation team — not to
    write the SATUSEHAT API integration itself.
  </p>
</CaseSection>


